1
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:00,840
My grandpa was generous and charitable.

2
00:01:01,119 --> 00:01:02,479
He saved lives asking nothing in return.

3
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:03,920
Benefactor Li,

4
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,239
you killed your savior with your own hands.

5
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:07,400
You're going to hell.

6
00:01:09,519 --> 00:01:10,120
Madam,

7
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,760
don't listen to their nonsense.

8
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:13,439
They sneaked into our home

9
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,439
- just for the money! - Shut up!

10
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,519
As to who's talking nonsense,

11
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:17,439
I can judge for myself.

12
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,599
Those who accidentally killed the wives

13
00:01:22,159 --> 00:01:23,680
and Mengzhu are Chunmei and her siblings.

14
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:26,439
However, their motive for murder

15
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,280
wasn't for money at all.

16
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:30,680
That's right.

17
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,599
My siblings and I infiltrated the Li household

18
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,400
just to

19
00:01:34,959 --> 00:01:36,400
seek justice for Elder Ding and Xiao Bao.

20
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,640
You're talking nonsense!

21
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:40,599
To repay Elder Ding for saving my life,

22
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:41,840
I built a bridge for their family.

23
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,319
But the river was deep and fast,

24
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,959
so the bridge just wouldn't hold.

25
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:46,879
You're insane! You're a monster!

26
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,920
You tied Xiao Bao up as a Sacrifice to the River God,

27
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:49,879
for a human foundation sacrifice!

28
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,079
Madam, you see...

29
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:51,760
You must stand up for me!

30
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,640
Just stay out of this!

31
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:56,280
What did you say happened to Xiao Bao?

32
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:58,200
Benefactor Li

33
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,480
drowned Elder Ding and Xiao Bao for a human foundation sacrifice.

34
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,439
Let me go!

35
00:02:02,439 --> 00:02:02,959
Grandpa!

36
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,560
You bandits!

37
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,400
Help me!

38
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:04,879
Behave!

39
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:05,680
Grandpa!

40
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,439
Grandpa!

41
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:07,359
Let me go!

42
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,639
You bandits!

43
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:09,479
Grandpa!

44
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:11,159
Help me, Grandpa!

45
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:13,280
You prefer the hard way!

46
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,639
Once you two are dead,

47
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,800
this land will be mine.

48
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:20,400
Do it!

49
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,879
Help me, Grandpa!

50
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:24,599
Offer them both as a Sacrifice to the River God!

51
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:27,159
A human foundation sacrifice! A Sacrifice to the River God!

52
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,360
Heaven and Earth, hear my plea,

53
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:31,840
Lord Lao, show your divinity!

54
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,080
Help me, Grandpa!

55
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:37,879
Elder Ding!

56
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,879
Xiao Bao! Xiao Bao!

57
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:40,680
Xiao Bao! Xiao Bao!

58
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,879
Elder Ding! Xiao Bao!

59
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:44,199
Xiao Bao!

60
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:54,319
Inspector Mu

61
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:57,039
Benefactor Li is the real murderer.

62
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,800
We sneaked into the Li residence

63
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,560
just to assassinate him alone.

64
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,919
We never meant to mistakenly kill the wives and the young lady.

65
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,000
Wait.

66
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,400
You mean

67
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,280
Elder Ding and Xiao Bao

68
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,960
were both killed by him?

69
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:11,919
Then why didn't the police arrest him?

70
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:13,919
Right, exactly.

71
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,039
Brilliant, Madam.

72
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:15,599
You, shut up.

73
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,840
Spot on.

74
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:17,800
Master.

75
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,879
The grandfather and grandson who lived here,

76
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,560
could they be the two you saw in your hallucination?

77
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,080
Put under a bridge as a human foundation sacrifice,

78
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,439
their spirits won't rest.

79
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,800
This female inspector

80
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,599
and her dad are birds of a feather.

81
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,360
They've both been bought off by Benefactor Li.

82
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,039
We should just kill them all

83
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,479
to avenge Elder Ding and Xiao Bao.

84
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,080
Boss.

85
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:36,080
The boss is right.

86
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,759
This female inspector protects scumbags.

87
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,960
She's no good either.

88
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,039
Listen to me.

89
00:03:41,199 --> 00:03:42,439
It's my fault for being soft-hearted.

90
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,360
I thought this female inspector would uphold the law.

91
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,400
Who knew

92
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:48,879
she'd only investigate us for accidentally killing

93
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:49,680
the wives and the young lady,

94
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,400
completely ignoring Benefactor Li killing them for their house.

95
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:57,000
I'm going to ask you today,

96
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:58,719
we hinted to you multiple times

97
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,360
to investigate Elder Ding and Xiao Bao's case.

98
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,039
Why did you turn a blind eye?

99
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:06,680
Chief!

100
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:07,520
I want to report a crime!

101
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:08,960
I saw it with my own eyes.

102
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,960
Elder Ding and Xiao Bao were murdered by Benefactor Li!

103
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,599
Enough.

104
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,800
We've already investigated this.

105
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,919
Elder Ding and his grandson were fishing,

106
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,959
slipped into the water,

107
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,120
and due to poor swimming skills,

108
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,079
accidentally drowned.

109
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,560
Stop making up lies here!

110
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:22,519
Elder Ding and Xiao Bao didn't slip into the water.

111
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,920
It was Benefactor Li.

112
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,560
He wanted to seize Elder Ding's land,

113
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,759
so he sank them to the bottom of the river to drown!

114
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,319
Right.

115
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,800
You're saying Benefactor Li

116
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,839
wanted to seize Elder Ding's land?

117
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,519
Benefactor Li would have to be out of his mind

118
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,399
to want Elder Ding's worthless plot of land

119
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,199
and run-down house.

120
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,000
If you ask me,

121
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,240
you're the one who's out of your mind.

122
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:41,800
Men!

123
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:42,959
- Take her out. - It really was Li

124
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,160
who killed Elder Ding and Xiao Bao!

125
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:45,120
- Investigate it again! - Move.

126
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,000
- Keep moving. - Chief!

127
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,720
Chief!

128
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:47,439
Keep moving.

129
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,279
I don't have the spare time

130
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,879
to investigate how some wretched old man died.

131
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,920
I heard Master Li say

132
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:06,560
that this gold ingot

133
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,040
is an antique from the Yuncang Kingdom.

134
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,519
Your father took bribes from Benefactor Li.

135
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,639
He and Benefactor Li are birds of a feather.

136
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,600
No, don't get this wrong.

137
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,920
My father is my father,

138
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,000
and I am me.

139
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:21,319
I have no ties to Benefactor Li whatsoever.

140
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:23,199
If my father doesn't solve this case today,

141
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,240
I will definitely take over.

142
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,000
As long as I'm in Lijia Town,

143
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,319
there will be no unjust or false cases.

144
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:28,240
Madam.

145
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:28,920
- Shut up. - You... you...

146
00:05:30,839 --> 00:05:31,439
You keep talking.

147
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,319
Just when we had nowhere to seek justice,

148
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,680
we happened to see the Li residence was hiring.

149
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,240
Good.

150
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:42,879
Next.

151
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:44,680
Hiring!

152
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,720
The Li residence is hiring!

153
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:48,319
Okay.

154
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:49,560
Alright, next.

155
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:50,839
Zhang Yong.

156
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:52,079
Okay.

157
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,600
- Next. - Thank you.

158
00:05:56,199 --> 00:05:57,079
My name is Liu Wei.

159
00:05:57,079 --> 00:05:57,519
Okay.

160
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:58,920
- Okay. - Thank you.

161
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,439
Mister, I can do needlework.

162
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,240
Needlework?

163
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:02,879
Needlework.

164
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:06,519
And what about these two?

165
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,439
He can do carpentry.

166
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,160
I do carpentry,

167
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:09,399
and I'm good at carving.

168
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,120
Look, I made this.

169
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:18,800
Nice.

170
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,600
As for me...

171
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:21,399
- His younger brother. - We're a trio. A trio.

172
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,279
I can...

173
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:23,920
I can do flower arranging.

174
00:06:24,279 --> 00:06:24,759
Flower arranging?

175
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,399
Yes.

176
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,199
Flower arranging.

177
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,319
Good, alright.

178
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,839
I'll take all three of you then.

179
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,920
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

180
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:33,399
So we siblings sneaked into the Li residence,

181
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,680
and began our plan to assassinate Benefactor Li.

182
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,680
These round holes through the walls,

183
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,199
when the wind blows through them,

184
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,160
create resonance,

185
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,680
producing these strange sounds.

186
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,639
This Desert Rose,

187
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,439
both in appearance and smell,

188
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,000
is very similar to Oleander.

189
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,759
The killer used the Oleander from the garden

190
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:53,240
to replace the Desert Rose.

191
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:55,560
The First Madam drank the highly toxic Oleander

192
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,560
and was poisoned to death.

193
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,319
Madam! Madam!

194
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:58,839
What made the garden's flowers wither

195
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,879
is the Caustic soda in this soil.

196
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:02,759
This dressing table

197
00:07:03,279 --> 00:07:04,279
should have been further inside,

198
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,279
but was dragged here.

199
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,160
To execute this plan precisely, the killer

200
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:11,279
even tampered with the hemp rope in advance.

201
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,519
At 1:00 PM,

202
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:14,319
they focused the magnifying glass's light

203
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,959
onto the chandelier's hemp rope,

204
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,439
burning it until it snapped.

205
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,959
The flower demon killed someone!

206
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,360
This water intake valve

207
00:07:22,879 --> 00:07:23,839
was newly built.

208
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,720
Someone modified the water valve.

209
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:26,920
I promised him

210
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,240
that after singing "Cinnabar Well",

211
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,480
I would go with him to Cuixiang Pavilion for dinner.

212
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,879
Someone purposely drew Miasma into the Li residence,

213
00:07:34,079 --> 00:07:35,040
turning it into a murder weapon.

214
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,560
This was originally Master Li's bedroom.

215
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,360
This wooden puppet

216
00:07:39,879 --> 00:07:40,839
has been rigged with hidden weapons.

217
00:07:41,959 --> 00:07:43,240
So the killer's target

218
00:07:44,199 --> 00:07:45,360
must have been Master Li.

219
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,240
Chunmei

220
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,720
This puppet

221
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,079
was Xiao Bao's toy.

222
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,079
Every time it appeared beside the victims,

223
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,519
you must have put it there, right?

224
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:04,959
That's right.

225
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,800
I just wanted to remind Benefactor Li

226
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,800
that someone would avenge Elder Ding and Xiao Bao.

227
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,519
But in taking revenge for them,

228
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,759
you killed many innocent people.

229
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,720
How are you any different from murderers?

230
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,800
We only wanted to kill Benefactor Li.

231
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:24,120
But he luckily escaped every time.

232
00:08:25,519 --> 00:08:26,399
We never thought

233
00:08:26,439 --> 00:08:27,839
we'd accidentally kill the wives and young lady.

234
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:31,120
Just when we were at our wits' end,

235
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,840
the three sisters returned.

236
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,759
We listened to Grandpa

237
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:37,960
and stayed in the provincial capital,

238
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,960
going to school and learning acrobatics.

239
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,879
But when we finally returned to Lijia Town,

240
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,679
Grandpa was already gone.

241
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:49,879
Why did Grandpa's thatched cottage

242
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,399
turn into a big mansion?

243
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,320
Coming! Coming!

244
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,600
Sister Chunmei,

245
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,399
where is Grandpa?

246
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:04,840
Come inside first.

247
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,840
We siblings hid in the Li household,

248
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,519
plotting to kill Benefactor Li,

249
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:17,960
solely to avenge Elder Ding and Xiao Bao.

250
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,039
But that Benefactor Li,

251
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,039
as if he had an expert helping him,

252
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:25,360
dodged death at critical moments every time.

253
00:09:26,799 --> 00:09:28,360
That's why we kept failing.

254
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,559
I regret it so much every single day.

255
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,120
The three wives treated me with such kindness.

256
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,039
Because of our negligence,

257
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,440
they died innocent and tragic deaths.

258
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:41,039
I am truly unforgivable.

259
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,679
It's my fault for lacking skill,

260
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,919
and accidentally killing the three wives.

261
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:50,919
At the temple,

262
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,639
I lit ever-burning lamps for the wives.

263
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,720
I hope they can rest in peace soon.

264
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,080
But what good does that do?

265
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,360
We caused all of this.

266
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,039
We deserve to die a thousand deaths.

267
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,159
Since we tried everything

268
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,720
and still couldn't kill Benefactor Li,

269
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:11,840
then we'll torture him every day,

270
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:13,440
to make his life a living hell.

271
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,000
We sisters

272
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,039
learned great skills at the acrobatics troupe.

273
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,440
We can definitely handle him.

274
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,360
I can do disguises.

275
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,080
I can sing opera.

276
00:10:24,399 --> 00:10:25,279
I have a plan.

277
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:56,759
Hurry!

278
00:10:57,039 --> 00:10:57,519
Hurry!

279
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,720
This is the truth behind the haunting at Li Manor.

280
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,600
The six of us worked together

281
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:29,759
just to punish

282
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:31,600
